{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17302","headline":"送信安刘少府 · 权德舆","name":"送信安刘少府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"相看结离念，尽此林中渌。\n夷代轻远游，上才随薄禄。\n参卿滞孙楚，隐市同梅福。\n吏散时泛弦，宾来闲覆局。\n襟情无俗虑，谈笑成逸躅。\n此路足滩声，羡君多水宿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17302.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17302","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}